er"},{"key":"B","text":"forest"},{"key":"C","text":"lake"},{"key":"D","text":"mountain"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"forest 的意思是森林。","verify":"\"forest\""},{"id":"cne_p130_q1","topicId":"cne_p130","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"问「河里有鱼吗」，应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Is there any fish are?"},{"key":"B","text":"There are fish?"},{"key":"C","text":"Do there fish?"},{"key":"D","text":"Are there any fish in the river?"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"fish 在这里看复数，用 Are there any。","verify":"\"Are there any fish in the river?\""},{"id":"cne_p130_q2","topicId":"cne_p130","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"Is there a lake? 肯定回答应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Yes, there is."},{"key":"B","text":"Yes, there are."},{"key":"C","text":"Yes, it is."},{"key":"D","text":"Yes, there be."}],"answer":"A","explanation":"Is there 的肯定回答是 Yes, there is。","verify":"\"Yes, there is.\""},{"id":"cne_p130_q3","topicId":"cne_p130","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Are there any mountains? 否定回答应选哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"No, there is not."},{"key":"B","text":"No, there are not."},{"key":"C","text":"No, they are not."},{"key":"D","text":"No, there not."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Are there 的否定回答是 No, there are not。","verify":"\"No, there are not.\""},{"id":"cne_p130_q4","topicId":"cne_p130","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"There is one forest and there are two rivers. 河有几条？","answer":"2","explanation":"two rivers 是 2 条河。","verify":"2"},{"id":"cne_p131_q1","topicId":"cne_p131","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问公园里有没有湖，应说哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Is there a lake in the park?"},{"key":"B","text":"Are there a lake in the park?"},{"key":"C","text":"Is there any lakes?"},{"key":"D","text":"There is a lake?"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"一个湖用 Is there a lake。","verify":"\"Is there a lake in the park?\""},{"id":"cne_p131_q2","topicId":"cne_p131","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"There is a forest in the park. 公园里有什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一条河"},{"key":"B","text":"一片森林"},{"key":"C","text":"一座山"},{"key":"D","text":"一个湖"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"a forest。","verify":"\"一片森林\""},{"id":"cne_p131_q3","topicId":"cne_p131","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Are there any tall buildings? 这句是在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"有河吗"},{"key":"B","text":"有湖吗"},{"key":"C","text":"有高楼吗"},{"key":"D","text":"有森林吗"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"tall buildings 是高楼。","verify":"\"有高楼吗\""},{"id":"cne_p131_q4","topicId":"cne_p131","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"The nature park is quiet. 自然公园怎么样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"很吵"},{"key":"B","text":"很小"},{"key":"C","text":"很贵"},{"key":"D","text":"很安静"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"quiet 是安静。","verify":"\"很安静\""},{"id":"cne_p132_q1","topicId":"cne_p132","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：There is a lake in the park. There are some ducks on the lake. 湖上有什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"一些山"},{"key":"B","text":"一些鸭子"},{"key":"C","text":"一些高楼"},{"key":"D","text":"一条河"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"ducks on the lake。","verify":"\"一些鸭子\""},{"id":"cne_p132_q2","topicId":"cne_p132","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Is there a forest? Yes, there is. 有森林吗？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"没有"},{"key":"B","text":"只有河"},{"key":"C","text":"有"},{"key":"D","text":"短文没回答"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"Yes, there is。","verify":"\"有\""},{"id":"cne_p132_q3","topicId":"cne_p132","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：There are no tall buildings. There is a river. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"有高楼，没有河。"},{"key":"B","text":"有一座山。"},{"key":"C","text":"什么都没有。"},{"key":"D","text":"没有高楼，有一条河。"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"no tall buildings，there is a river。","verify":"\"没有高楼，有一条河。\""},{"id":"cne_p132_q4","topicId":"cne_p132","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"读一读：There are two mountains behind the lake. 湖后面有几座山？","answer":"2","explanation":"two mountains。","verify":"2"}]
